title: Background
description: About the psychologist behind Ankersted
---
**My professional background**

I am a psychologist with a PhD and trained in both the USA and Denmark. My professional experience is broad, and for more than a decade I have worked with people from many different backgrounds and in many different life situations.

- **2016–2020 (New York):** Worked as a psychologist in Greenwich Village, primarily with young people and adults in education.
- **2020–present (Denmark):** Have worked closely with children, young people, and wellbeing—first as a psychologist in Midtjylland at PPL in Viborg Municipality, and later in Nordjylland as a psychologist in Aalborg Municipality.

What is shared across all of my work is a genuine interest in people’s possibilities and conditions, and a wish to create the best possible frame for each person’s wellbeing and development.
